      <activity id="13704b7c-0764-5fb9-9526-8a0c97a72b7a" activityNameId="0a188cde-5ec4-5051-b55e-556bbbf84758" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ammonium thiocyanate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ammonium thiocyanate, at plant
The process "ammonium thiocyanate, at plant, GLO" is modelled for the production of  ammonium thiocyanate from carbon disulfide and ammonia in the world.  Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation, Energy consumptions,  emissions, infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 001762-95-4; 
Formula: NH4SCN; 
UUID: fda1fcb2-a9d4-3946-bcd1-4941fbc40c8a
Production of ammonium thiocyanate including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world.
Technology: Amination of carbon disulfide.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Standard values 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions,  emissions, infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fda1fcb2-a9d4-3946-bcd1-4941fbc40c8a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
